{"q":"3004","t":"Maximum Subtree of the Same Color","d":"Medium","p":true,"c":null,"h":["For each node, define a <code>flag[v]</code> indicating that the subtree of this node contains only one color or not.","In the DFS process, when you call <code>dfs(u)</code> from node <code>v</code>, after that DFS of <code>u</code> has finished, check if <code>flag[u] == false</code>, then <code>flag[v]</code> is also <code>false</code>.","Also if <code>color[v] != color[u]</code>, <code>flag[v]</code> becomes <code>false</code>."],"m":"{\n  \"name\": \"maximumSubtreeSize\",\n  \"params\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"edges\",\n      \"type\": \"integer[][]\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"integer[]\",\n      \"name\": \"colors\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"return\": {\n    \"type\": \"integer\"\n  }\n}","g":[{"name":"Array","slug":"array"},{"name":"Dynamic Programming","slug":"dynamic-programming"},{"name":"Tree","slug":"tree"},{"name":"Depth-First Search","slug":"depth-first-search"}]}